The legal texts are official texts of Montenegro (the Constitution of 2007 and its amendments, and laws),
as published in Službeni list Crne Gore, the Official Gazette of Montenegro (www.sluzbenilist.me, act
pages and PDFs), retrieved 29 October 2026. Laws, other regulations and official acts are not protected
by copyright under the Law on Copyright and Related Rights (Zakon o autorskom i srodnim pravima).

Changes made by Lexifina: each amendment was applied by code to the provision its own instruction names;
each version was converted to one Markdown file per provision, one paragraph or numbered point per line;
spacing was normalised and letter-spaced headings were joined; and the versions were arranged as git
commits credited to the amendments and laws that made each change. The wording of the law was not changed,
and no text was transliterated between scripts. The Official Gazette does not endorse this repository.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the
tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
